#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"El código de esta página fue desarrollado con los siguientes requisitos.\n"
"Recomendamos usar estas versiones o más recientes.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To facilitate the development and reuse of custom transpilation code by the wider community of Qiskit users, the Qiskit SDK supports a plugin interface that enables third-party Python packages to declare that they provide extended transpilation functionality accessible via Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Para facilitar el desarrollo y la reutilización de código de transpilación personalizado por parte de la comunidad de usuarios de Qiskit, el SDK de Qiskit admite una interfaz de plugins que permite que paquetes Python de terceros declaren que proporcionan funcionalidad de transpilación extendida accesible a través de Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently, third-party plugins can provide extended transpilation functionality in three ways:\n"
msgstr "Actualmente, los plugins de terceros pueden proporcionar funcionalidad de transpilación extendida de tres maneras:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [transpiler stage plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) provides a pass manager that can be used in place of one of the [6 stages](transpiler-stages) of a preset staged pass manager: `init`, `layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization`, and `scheduling`.\n"
msgstr "Un [plugin de etapa de transpilador](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) proporciona un administrador de pases que puede usarse en lugar de una de las [6 etapas](transpiler-stages) de un administrador de pases por etapas preestablecido: `init`, `layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization` y `scheduling`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [unitary synthesis plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin) provides extended functionality for unitary gate synthesis.\n"
msgstr "Un [plugin de síntesis unitaria](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin) proporciona funcionalidad extendida para la síntesis de puertas unitarias.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [high-level synthesis plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin) provides extended functionality for synthesizing \"high-level objects\" such as linear functions or Clifford operators. High-level objects are represented by subclasses of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class.\n"
msgstr "Un [plugin de síntesis de alto nivel](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin) proporciona funcionalidad extendida para sintetizar \"objetos de alto nivel\", como funciones lineales u operadores Clifford. Los objetos de alto nivel están representados por subclases de la clase [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The rest of the page describes how to list available plugins, install new ones, and use them.\n"
msgstr "El resto de la página describe cómo listar los plugins disponibles, instalar nuevos y usarlos.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available plugins and install new ones {#list-available-plugins-and-install-new-ones}"
msgstr "Listar plugins disponibles e instalar nuevos {#list-available-plugins-and-install-new-ones}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit already includes some built-in plugins for transpilation. To install more, you can use your Python package manager. For example, you might run `pip install qiskit-toqm` to install the [Qiskit TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm) routing stage plugin. A number of third-party plugins are part of the [Qiskit ecosystem](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"
msgstr "Qiskit ya incluye algunos plugins integrados para la transpilación. Para instalar más, puedes usar tu administrador de paquetes de Python. Por ejemplo, podrías ejecutar `pip install qiskit-toqm` para instalar el plugin de etapa de enrutamiento [Qiskit TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm). Varios plugins de terceros forman parte del [ecosistema de Qiskit](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available transpiler stage plugins {#list-available-transpiler-stage-plugins}"
msgstr "Listar plugins de etapa de transpilador disponibles {#list-available-transpiler-stage-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins) function, passing the name of the stage whose plugins you want to list.\n"
msgstr "Usa la función [list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins), pasando el nombre de la etapa cuyos plugins quieres listar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid " If `qiskit-toqm` were installed, then `toqm` would appear in the list of `routing` plugins.\n"
msgstr " Si `qiskit-toqm` estuviera instalado, `toqm` aparecería en la lista de plugins de `routing`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available unitary synthesis plugins {#list-available-unitary-synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr "Listar plugins de síntesis unitaria disponibles {#list-available-unitary-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names) function.\n"
msgstr "Usa la función [unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available high-level synthesis plugins {#list-available-high-level-synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr "Listar plugins de síntesis de alto nivel disponibles {#list-available-high-level-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names) function, passing the name of the type of \"high-level object\" to be synthesized. The name corresponds to the [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) attribute of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
msgstr "Usa la función [high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names), pasando el nombre del tipo de \"objeto de alto nivel\" que se va a sintetizar. El nombre corresponde al atributo [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) de la clase [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) que representa el tipo de objeto que se está sintetizando.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the [HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager) class to list the names of all high-level synthesis plugins:\n"
msgstr "Puedes usar la clase [HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager) para listar los nombres de todos los plugins de síntesis de alto nivel:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a plugin {#use-a-plugin}"
msgstr "Usar un plugin {#use-a-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this section, we show how to use transpiler plugins. In the code examples, we use plugins that come with Qiskit, but plugins installed from third-party packages are used the same way.\n"
msgstr "En esta sección mostramos cómo usar plugins del transpilador. En los ejemplos de código usamos plugins que vienen con Qiskit, pero los plugins instalados desde paquetes de terceros se usan de la misma manera.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a transpiler stage plugin {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"
msgstr "Usar un plugin de etapa de transpilador {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a transpiler stage plugin, specify its name with the appropriate argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). The argument is formed by appending `_method` to the name of the transpilation stage. For example, to use the `lookahead` routing plugin, we would specify `lookahead` for the `routing_method` argument.\n"
msgstr "Para usar un plugin de etapa de transpilador, especifica su nombre con el argumento apropiado para [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) o [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). El argumento se forma añadiendo `_method` al nombre de la etapa de transpilación. Por ejemplo, para usar el plugin de enrutamiento `lookahead`, especificaríamos `lookahead` para el argumento `routing_method`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The  `FakeSherbrooke` mock backend from `qiskit_ibm_runtime` is used in these examples, but you can try it on any Qiskit-compatible real or fake backend.  Your results might be different.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"El backend simulado `FakeSherbrooke` de `qiskit_ibm_runtime` se usa en estos ejemplos, pero puedes probarlo con cualquier backend real o simulado compatible con Qiskit. Los resultados podrían ser diferentes.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a unitary synthesis plugin {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr "Usar un plugin de síntesis unitaria {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a unitary synthesis plugin, specify its name as the `unitary_synthesis_method` argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr "Para usar un plugin de síntesis unitaria, especifica su nombre como argumento `unitary_synthesis_method` para [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) o [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unitary synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and `optimization` stages of the staged pass manager returned by [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or used in [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these stages.\n"
msgstr "La síntesis unitaria se usa en las etapas `init`, `translation` y `optimization` del administrador de pases por etapas devuelto por [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) o utilizado en [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). Consulta [Etapas del transpilador](transpiler-stages) para una descripción de estas etapas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config` argument, a free-form dictionary, to pass options for the unitary synthesis method. The documentation of the synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in unitary synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr "Usa el argumento `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config`, un diccionario de forma libre, para pasar opciones para el método de síntesis unitaria. La documentación del método de síntesis debe explicar las opciones que admite. Consulta [esta lista](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-synthesis-plugins-2) para ver enlaces a la documentación de los plugins de síntesis unitaria integrados.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a high-level synthesis plugin {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr "Usar un plugin de síntesis de alto nivel {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, create an [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) to\n"
"store the names of the plugins to use for various high-level objects. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Primero, crea un objeto [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) para\n"
"almacenar los nombres de los plugins que se usarán para los distintos objetos de alto nivel. Por ejemplo:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This code cell creates a high-level synthesis configuration that uses the `layers` plugin\n"
"for synthesizing [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) objects and the `pmh` plugin for synthesizing\n"
"[LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction) objects. The names of the keyword arguments correspond to the\n"
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) attribute of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
"For each high-level object, the list of given plugins are tried in sequence until one of them\n"
"succeeds (in the example above, each list only contains a single plugin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Esta celda de código crea una configuración de síntesis de alto nivel que usa el plugin `layers`\n"
"para sintetizar objetos [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) y el plugin `pmh` para sintetizar\n"
"objetos [LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction). Los nombres de los argumentos de palabras clave corresponden al\n"
"atributo [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) de la clase [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) que representa el tipo de objeto que se está sintetizando.\n"
"Para cada objeto de alto nivel, la lista de plugins proporcionados se prueba en secuencia hasta que uno de ellos\n"
"tiene éxito (en el ejemplo anterior, cada lista contiene un único plugin).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to specifying\n"
"a plugin by its name, you can instead pass a `(name, options)` tuple, where the second element of the tuple is a dictionary containing options for the plugin. The documentation of the synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in high-level synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Además de especificar\n"
"un plugin por su nombre, también puedes pasar una tupla `(name, options)`, donde el segundo elemento de la tupla es un diccionario que contiene opciones para el plugin. La documentación del método de síntesis debe explicar las opciones que admite. Consulta [esta lista](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) para ver enlaces a la documentación de los plugins de síntesis de alto nivel integrados.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once you have created the `HLSConfig` object, pass it as the\n"
"`hls_config` argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr ""
"Una vez que hayas creado el objeto `HLSConfig`, pásalo como argumento\n"
"`hls_config` a [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) o [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "High-level synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and `optimization` stages of the staged pass manager returned by [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or used in [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these stages.\n"
msgstr "La síntesis de alto nivel se usa en las etapas `init`, `translation` y `optimization` del administrador de pases por etapas devuelto por [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) o utilizado en [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). Consulta [Etapas del transpilador](transpiler-stages) para una descripción de estas etapas.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos pasos {#next-steps}"

